<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - June 25.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - June 25.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the mid-session of trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the 12:45 was 4118.63,0.76 points or 0.02 percent lower than Tuesday's close.</p>
